        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 1979, a man named Masao Satomi was involved in an accident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > He was taken to the hospital and woke up safe and sound, but had amnesia. When he wonders if there is any memory he can recall, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >he recalls an intense childhood memory from 16 years ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The nostalgic atmosphere of the Showa period and the somewhat disturbing atmosphere of his childhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Masao tries to relive those memories and find out who he is and recover his precious memories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Title 6Days </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Genre Adventure, Human Mystery, Human Horror </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Play time About 2-5 hours </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Endings branching (4 endings in total) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Age 12 and up recommended</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Others </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game can be enjoyed on its own, but it also contains some of the material from the previous game “Retribution” .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please play “Reward-Retribution” as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guidelines </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regarding video, live streaming, and image posting for this game </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All scenes in the game can be posted. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Postings to sites that are offensive to public order and morals or that give a false impression of the game content are prohibited.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Synopsis </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 1979, a man named Masao Satomi was involved in an accident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > He was taken to the hospital and woke up safe and sound, but had amnesia. When he wonders if there is any memory he can recall, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >he recalls an intense childhood memory from 16 years ago.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The nostalgic atmosphere of the Showa period and the somewhat disturbing atmosphere of his childhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Masao tries to relive those memories and find out who he is and recover his precious memories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Title 6Days </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Genre Adventure, Human Mystery, Human Horror </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Play time About 2-5 hours </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Endings branching (4 endings in total) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Age 12 and up recommended</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Others </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game can be enjoyed on its own, but it also contains some of the material from the previous game “Retribution” .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please play “Reward-Retribution” as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guidelines </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regarding video, live streaming, and image posting for this game </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All scenes in the game can be posted. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Postings to sites that are offensive to public order and morals or that give a false impression of the game content are prohibited.</p>",
